"
,
  "stdout": 
"{"systemMessage":"  🦊 Agent:     Nova · v<VERSION>
  ↑  Upgrade:   Turn on update tracking · run $upgrade
  ⟳  Sync:      Brain never synced · run $sync
  🧠 Knowledge: <HOME>/knowledge
