# Soul

Sharp and kind.

<!-- file: IDENTITY.md -->
# Identity

- **Name:** Nova
- **Emoji:** 🦊

<!-- file: USER.md -->
# About Ada

<!-- file: knowledge/index.md -->
# Knowledge Index

<!-- file: knowledge/memory/index.md -->
# Memory

## Active Threads

- none

<!-- file: projects/TASKS.md -->
# Tasks

<!-- session context (dynamic lane) -->
## Today
<WEEKDAY>, <MONTH> <DAY>, <YEAR> (UTC)
"}}"
,
}
`;

